    640          /**
    641           *  @brief     FOC Control Loop for Bpm.
    642           *  @details   Field oriented control loop routine for Bpm:
    643           *             - d axis: rotor flux position
    644           *             - q axis: rotor flux quadrature axis
    645           *
    646           *             This routine is composed by three parts:
    647           *             - Input processing: tachometer signal processing
    648           *                                 motor speed reference absolute value
    649           *                                 motor phase currents swapping in order to work with a positive speed reference.
    650           *                                 dc Voltage filtering
    651           *
    652           *             - Slow Control Loop: slow dynamics controls (speed and Voltage) -> they generates current references
    653           *                                          - Iq reference is set by speed control
    654           *                                          - Id reference is set by Voltage control
    655           *                                  slow quantities calculation (torque, mean torque and vibration index)
    656           *                                  update of speed regulator gains/ fir filter taps/ flux estimator parameters
    657           *
    658           *             - Current Control Loop + Flux Position Estimation:                                        -
    659           *                                  flux estimator
    660           *                                  fast dynamics controls (currents) -> they generates Voltage references
    661           *                                  space vector modulation: -> it generates the duties
    662           *                                  duties swapping in accord to the speed sign.
